    summary: "本文回顧了 Canonical 與 IBM 合作十週年，強調 Ubuntu Server 在 s390x 架構（適用於 IBM Z 和 IBM LinuxONE）上的深度支援。這項合作使企業能夠將完整的 Ubuntu 開發生態系統帶入傳統大型主機（mainframe）環境，特別適用於金融和醫療等要求極高安全性的產業。Ubuntu 支援多種部署模式，包括 LPAR、z/VM、KVM、LXD 和 OCI 容器，提升了資源利用率。在技術層面，合作持續更新 s390-tools，並提供了 Secure Boot、IBM Secure Execution (TEE) 等功能，確保數據在靜止和使用時的保護。此外，Ubuntu 透過 Kernel Livepatch、FIPS 支援、量子安全演算法（ML-KEM/ML-DSA）等功能，為任務關鍵型工作負載提供了頂級的安全性、穩定性和合規性。Canonical 亦持續更新 Ubuntu 版本，並將其定位為在 IBM Z/LinuxONE 上進行 AI 發展的基礎生態系統。",
    tags: ["Ubuntu Server", "IBM Z", "IBM LinuxONE", "s390x", "Canonical", "任務關鍵型負載", "TEE"],
    title_en: "Ubuntu Celebrates Decade of Support for IBM Z and IBM LinuxONE, Strengthening Mission-Critical Workloads in Mainframe and Cloud Environments",
    summary_en: "This article reviews the tenth anniversary of the collaboration between Canonical and IBM, highlighting Ubuntu Server's deep support for the s390x architecture (applicable to IBM Z and IBM LinuxONE). This partnership enables enterprises to bring the complete Ubuntu development ecosystem into traditional mainframe environments, particularly suited for highly regulated industries such as finance and healthcare. Ubuntu supports multiple deployment models, including LPAR, z/VM, KVM, LXD, and OCI containers, enhancing resource utilization. At the technical level, the collaboration continuously updates s390-tools and provides features like Secure Boot and IBM Secure Execution (TEE), ensuring data protection both at rest and in use. Furthermore, Ubuntu offers top-tier security, stability, and compliance for mission-critical workloads through features such as Kernel Livepatch, FIPS support, and quantum-safe algorithms (ML-KEM/ML-DSA). Canonical also continuously updates Ubuntu versions, positioning it as the foundational ecosystem for AI development on IBM Z/LinuxONE.",
    tags_en: ["Ubuntu Server", "IBM Z", "IBM LinuxONE", "s390x", "Canonical", "Mission-Critical Workload", "TEE"],
    sources: [
      { name: "Ubuntu Security Notices", url: "https://ubuntu.com//blog/a-decade-of-ubuntu-on-ibm-z-and-ibm-linuxone", lang: "EN" }
    ]
