    id: "20260612-023",
    trackers: ["os"],
    category: "Apple",
    title: "Google Gemini for macOS 更新：介面優化與新功能整合，提升跨平台體驗",
    summary: "Google 發布了最新版本的 Gemini 應用程式，適用於 macOS 平台。本次更新（版本 1.72.2.419）主要著重於使用者介面（UI）的優化，使其更符合 iOS 和 Android 等其他平台風格，例如將應用程式圖標背景改為白色。此外，應用程式的設定頁面也進行了結構重組，將偏好設定分組為「外觀」、「快捷方式」、「個人智慧」、「Gemini 語音」、「關於」和「除錯」等獨立面板，提升了操作的邏輯性。在功能層面，Google 亦分享了新的操作手勢：同時按下 Command ⌘ 鍵，可實現將目前活動視窗無縫附加到聊天內容中，這大幅簡化了擷取螢幕截圖的步驟。雖然文章提到未來可能會有更完整的重新設計，但目前更新主要為介面和操作流程的精進，旨在提供更一致的跨平台使用者體驗。",
    tags: ["Google", "Gemini", "macOS", "UI/UX", "跨平台", "應用程式更新"],
    title_en: "Google Gemini for macOS Update: Interface Optimization and New Feature Integration Enhance Cross-Platform Experience",
    summary_en: "Google has released the latest version of the Gemini application for the macOS platform. This update (version 1.72.2.419) primarily focuses on optimizing the User Interface (UI) to align it more closely with the aesthetics of other platforms like iOS and Android, such as changing the application icon background to white. Furthermore, the application's settings page has undergone structural reorganization, grouping preferences into independent panels such as \"Appearance,\" \"Shortcuts,\" \"Personal Intelligence,\" \"Gemini Voice,\" \"About,\" and \"Debugging,\" thereby improving operational logic. On the functional front, Google also introduced new gestures: pressing Command ⌘ simultaneously allows the current active window to be seamlessly attached to the chat content, significantly simplifying the process of capturing screenshots. Although the article mentions that a more comprehensive redesign may be coming in the future, the current update mainly focuses on interface and workflow refinements, aiming to provide a more consistent cross-platform user experience.",
    tags_en: ["Google", "Gemini", "macOS", "UI/UX", "Cross-Platform", "Application Update"],
    sources: [
      { name: "9to5Google", url: "https://9to5google.com/2026/06/12/gemini-macos-updates", lang: "EN" }
    ]
